  day: 2
  text: "G-Good morning! Robert, if you forgot! I heard they set you up yesterday.
    Yeah they sometimes do that to you. But don\u2019t let it get you down! If you
    don\u2019t think about the bad stuff they do to us then it\u2019s easier to filter
    out the wake-up siren in the morning! You can even sometimes smile! S-sorry you
    probably already knew that. You can just send me to work now."
